'''Shibalien Elite''' (エリートエイリワン, ''Erītoeiriwan'', '''Elite Aliwan''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Shibalien]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shibalien Elite
|image = E 360.png
|first appearance = ''' CotC''': [[Earth (Cats of the Cosmos)|Chapter 1 - Earth]]<br>
'''SoL''': [[Roswell Incident|Sub-chapter 43 - Roswell Incident]]<br>
'''Aku Realms''': [[Brazil (Aku Realm)|Brazil/Tochigi]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Hard-Luck Homestay|Sub-chapter 4 - Hard-Luck Homestay]]
|money drop = 100¢ - 395¢
}}

==Enemy==
A slightly faster [[Shibalien]] with a mohawk and a thicker tail; and a lot stronger. He can warp cats back 750 range at 35% chance.

== Strategy==
Since Shibalien Elite is an Alien enemy, he can be slowed by [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Neo Psychocat]] or frozen by [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]]. Meatshields can help, but might be warped away. A small stack of [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] can be used to fend off Shibalien Elites, and a level 27 (or higher) [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can one-shot this enemy in his first appearance.

